        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-h">AI rewrite instruction</div>
          <div class="card-b">
            <p class="muted tiny f-help">Used by the AI rewrite switch instead of the built-in clean-up. Leave empty for the default behaviour.</p>
            <div class="field" style="margin-top:12px"><textarea class="in" id="setAiPrompt" rows="3" placeholder="Leave empty for the default clean-up behaviour"></textarea></div>
            <div class="row-actions"><button class="btn btn-p" id="aiPromptSave">Save instruction</button></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-h">Global header &amp; footer <span class="muted tiny">— used when a template's own zone is empty</span></div>
          <div class="card-b">
            <p class="muted tiny f-help"><b>Header</b> — added on top when the Auto headers switch is ON. Leave it EMPTY for the post's title line (the first line, bolded). <b>Footer</b> — added at the bottom when the Signature switch is ON. Placeholders <code>{text} {title} {source} {date} {time} {hashtags}</code> work in both.</p>
            <div class="field" style="margin-top:12px">
              <label for="headerInput">Header text</label>
              <div class="row-form"><input class="in" id="headerInput" placeholder="e.g. *Daily Updates* — {date}  (empty = title line)"><button class="btn btn-p" id="headerSave">Save header</button></div>
            </div>
            <div class="field" style="margin-top:12px">
              <label for="signatureInput">Footer text</label>
              <div class="row-form"><input class="in" id="signatureInput" placeholder="Footer, e.g. — @MyChannel · daily updates"><button class="btn btn-p" id="signatureSave">Save footer</button></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="brand-grid">
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-h">Brand colors <%- icon('layers','icon') %></div>
            <div class="card-b">
              <p class="muted tiny f-help">These colors drive every card the Announcement tool renders (PNG + SVG). Pick a preset to start, then fine-tune any color. Nothing else in the bot is affected.</p>
              <div class="brand-presets" id="brandPresets" style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap"></div>
              <div class="brand-fields" id="brandFields" style="margin-top:14px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(170px,1fr));gap:10px"></div>
              <div class="row-actions" style="margin-top:14px">
                <button class="btn btn-p" id="brandSave"><%- icon('save','icon icon-xs') %> Save brand</button>
                <button class="btn btn-g" id="brandReset">Reset to defaults</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-h">Live preview <%- icon('image','icon') %> <span class="muted tiny">— updates as you type</span></div>
            <div class="card-b" style="text-align:center">
              <img id="brandPreview" alt="Card preview" width="300" height="300" style="max-width:100%;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--line)">
              <p class="muted tiny" style="margin-top:10px">1080×1080 — exactly what the Announcement card tool will render.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ═══ CONTENT · APPROVAL QUEUE (5A · R37/R43) ═══ -->
      <section class="view" data-view="approvals" hidden>
      <div class="vtab-row" role="tablist" aria-label="Queue & Scheduled">
        <button class="vtab" data-go="approvals" role="tab">Queue</button>
        <button class="vtab" data-go="scheduled" role="tab">Scheduled</button>
      </div>

        <div class="ph">
          <div class="ph-l"><h2>Approval queue</h2><div class="ph-d">Review each post before it reaches its selected targets — approve, edit or discard. The Live Queue shows what is pending, in flight or failed right now.</div></div>
          <div class="ph-a">
            <div class="tabs" id="queueTabs">
              <button class="tab on" data-qt="approvals">Approvals <span class="pill num" id="queueBadge" hidden>0</span></button>
              <button class="tab" data-qt="live">Live Queue <span class="pill num" id="liveBadge" hidden>0</span></button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="queueTabApprovals">
          <div class="card" data-hov>
            <div class="card-h">How the queue works <%- icon('info','icon') %></div>
            <div class="card-b">
              <div class="sw-grid" id="swQueue"></div>
              <p class="muted tiny f-help">Turn the switch ON, then pick per source: open the source's <b>Rules</b> (Sources tab) and tick <b>Approve first</b>. You can also add a delay buffer: every post waits N minutes before publishing — you can still cancel it in the meantime.</p>
              <div class="row-form wrap" style="margin-top:12px">
                <label class="sw-inline"><span>Delay buffer (minutes, 0 = off)</span><input class="in" id="queueDelay" type="number" min="0" max="1440" style="flex:none;width:110px" title="Every post waits this long before publishing"></label>
                <button class="btn" id="queueDelaySave" style="flex:none">Save buffer</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- v11 · mockup 03: status filter chips (real counts, client-side filter — no re-fetch) -->
          <div class="qchips-row" id="queueChips"></div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-h">Waiting for your decision <span class="pill num" id="pendingCount">0</span>
              <button class="btn btn-p btn-sm" id="queueApproveAll" style="margin-left:auto"><%- icon('check','icon icon-xs') %> Bulk approve</button>
            </div>
            <div class="card-b"><div id="queueList"></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="queueTabLive" hidden>
          <div class="kpis" id="liveKpis"></div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-h">Failed posts — kept in the queue until retried or dismissed <%- icon('alert','icon') %>
              <button class="btn btn-sm btn-d" id="queueRetryAll" style="margin-left:auto"><%- icon('refresh','icon icon-xs') %> Retry all failed</button>
            </div>
            <div class="card-b"><div id="liveFailed"></div><p class="muted tiny" id="recoveryNote"></p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ═══ CONTENT · POSTS ═══ -->
      <section class="view" data-view="posts" hidden>
        <div class="ph">
          <div class="ph-l"><h2>History</h2><div class="ph-d">Everything the bot published, skipped or failed — with retry, edit and delete.</div></div>
          <div class="ph-a">
            <button class="btn btn-d" id="postsDelete"><%- icon('trash','icon icon-xs') %> Delete selected</button>
            <button class="btn" id="postsRefresh"><%- icon('refresh','icon icon-xs') %> Refresh</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Signal Desk §1.3: read-only chips for automations that shaped this history -->
        <div class="rosw-row" id="historySwitchChips" hidden></div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-h">Publish history</div>
          <div class="card-b">
            <p class="muted tiny f-help" id="editpostsNote">Editing and deleting needs the Edit posts switch below — it is experimental.</p>
            <!-- 5B (R53): filters — applied to the loaded list, no re-fetch -->
            <div class="row-form wrap" id="postsFilterRow" style="margin-top:10px">
              <select class="in" id="pfStatus" style="flex:none;width:auto" title="Filter by status">
                <option value="">All statuses</option><option value="published">Published</option><option value="queued">In queue</option><option value="pending">Waiting approval</option><option value="skipped">Skipped</option><option value="failed">Failed</option>
              </select>
              <select class="in" id="pfSource" style="flex:none;width:auto" title="Filter by source channel"><option value="">All sources</option></select>
              <input class="in" id="pfText" placeholder="Full-text search (Ctrl K also finds these)…" title="Search the post text" style="flex:1;min-width:160px;height:30px;font-size:var(--t13)" aria-label="Search post text">
              <span class="muted tiny" id="pfCount"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="tw" style="margin-top:12px"><table class="t" id="postsTable"><thead><tr><th></th><th>When</th><th>Source</th><th>Status</th><th>Detail</th><th>Actions</th></tr></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-h">Edit posts <%- icon('pencil','icon') %></div>
          <div class="card-b"><div class="sw-grid" id="swPosts"></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-h">Delete by date range <%- icon('trash','icon') %></div>
          <div class="card-b">
            <div class="row-form wrap">
              <select class="in" id="purgeTarget" title="Target channel"></select>
              <input class="in" id="purgeFrom" type="date" style="flex:none;width:auto" title="From date">
              <span class="muted">to</span>
              <input class="in" id="purgeTo" type="date" style="flex:none;width:auto" title="To date">
              <button class="btn btn-d" id="purgeBtn" style="flex:none">Delete range</button>
            </div>
            <p class="muted tiny" id="purgeResult"></p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card" data-hov>
          <div class="card-h">Undo last published post <%- icon('undo','icon') %></div>
          <div class="card-b">
            <div class="row-form wrap">
              <select class="in" id="undoTarget" title="The target channel to undo on"></select>
              <button class="btn btn-d" id="undoBtn" style="flex:none"><%- icon('undo','icon icon-xs') %> Delete last post there</button>
            </div>
            <p class="muted tiny f-help">Deletes the most recent bot-published post on that one target (confirmed before it runs). The publish history keeps the record.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- 5H (R86): evergreen recycling -->
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-h">Evergreen recycling <%- icon('refresh','icon') %> <span class="muted tiny">— re-share proven posts within a daily quota</span></div>
          <div class="card-b">
            <p class="muted tiny f-help">The bot re-publishes your older, working text posts on a rotation so a quiet day still has content. Off by default. It honors the same per-target rate guard, is text-only, never recycles a post twice inside the 21-day rotation, and stops on the global pause or panic.</p>
            <div class="row-form wrap" style="margin-top:10px">
              <input class="in num" id="egrQuota" placeholder="Per day" style="flex:none;width:130px" inputmode="numeric">
              <input class="in num" id="egrMinAge" placeholder="Older than (days)" style="flex:none;width:170px" inputmode="numeric">
              <button class="btn btn-p" id="egrSave" style="flex:none">Save</button>
              <span class="muted tiny" id="egrState" style="align-self:center"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="tw" style="margin-top:10px"><table class="t" id="egrLog"><thead><tr><th>When</th><th>Post</th><th class="num">Targets</th></tr></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ═══ CONTENT · TEMPLATES v2 ═══ -->
      </section>

