        <button class="vtab" data-go="aipilot" role="tab">AI Pilot</button>
      </div>

        <div class="ph"><div class="ph-l"><h2>Pilot</h2><div class="ph-d">The AI reads every incoming post and only publishes the ones that match your rule.</div></div></div>
