          <div class="card-h">Pilot <%- icon('bot','icon') %></div>
          <div class="card-b"><div class="sw-grid" id="swAipilot"></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-h">Pilot rule</div>
          <div class="card-b">
            <p class="muted tiny f-help">When on, only posts matching this rule are published. If AI is unreachable, posts pass through (never silently lost).</p>
            <div class="row-form" style="margin-top:12px">
              <input class="in" id="aipilotInput" placeholder="e.g. only government job announcements in Punjab">
              <button class="btn btn-p" id="aipilotSave">Save rule</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- 5J (J7): AI safety screen — OFF by default (R8) -->
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-h">Safety screen <%- icon('shield','icon') %> <span class="muted tiny">— the last line before a post is routed</span></div>
          <div class="card-b">
            <p class="muted tiny f-help">Turn the <b>AI safety screen</b> switch on (in the card above) and give a one-line rule like “no political content, no ban-risk words”. Every FINAL post must match it — the AI checks the text after all other steps. Fail-open: if the AI is unreachable the post publishes as usual (nothing is ever silently lost).</p>
            <div class="row-form" style="margin-top:12px">
              <input class="in" id="aisafetyInput" placeholder="e.g. must be safe, legal and free of political content">
              <button class="btn btn-p" id="aisafetySave">Save rule</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ═══ AUTOMATION · AUTO-REPLY ═══ -->
      <section class="view" data-view="aireply" hidden>
      <div class="vtab-row" role="tablist" aria-label="Auto-Replies & AI Pilot">
        <button class="vtab" data-go="aireply" role="tab">Auto-Replies</button>
        <button class="vtab" data-go="aipilot" role="tab">AI Pilot</button>
      </div>

        <div class="ph"><div class="ph-l"><h2>Replies</h2><div class="ph-d">The AI answers personal WhatsApp messages for you.</div></div></div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-h">AI auto-reply</div>
          <div class="card-b"><div class="sw-grid" id="swAireply"></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-h">Reply instruction</div>
          <div class="card-b">
            <p class="muted tiny f-help">Used when the AI auto-reply switch is ON: how the AI should answer personal WhatsApp messages for you. Leave empty for the default (brief, warm, same language).</p>
            <div class="field" style="margin-top:12px"><textarea class="in" id="aireplyPrompt" rows="3" placeholder="e.g. You are the owner's assistant. Answer questions about our channel briefly."></textarea></div>
            <div class="row-actions"><button class="btn btn-p" id="aireplyPromptSave">Save instruction</button></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- 5C (R59): knowledge-base auto-reply — exact stored answers, no AI -->
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-h">Knowledge base (exact answers) <%- icon('reply','icon') %></div>
          <div class="card-b"><div class="sw-grid" id="swReplyKb"></div></div>
          <div class="card-b" style="border-top:1px solid var(--border)">
            <p class="muted tiny f-help">Stored question → answer pairs. When someone on the allowlist messages something close to a stored question, the exact answer is sent back — no AI, no cost. When it answers, the AI auto-reply stands down for that message. An EMPTY allowlist means nobody is auto-replied.</p>
            <div class="row-form wrap" id="kbList" style="margin-top:12px"><span class="muted tiny">No pairs yet.</span></div>
            <div class="row-form wrap" style="margin-top:12px">
              <input class="in" id="kbQ" placeholder="Question, e.g. What are your business hours?">
              <input class="in" id="kbA" placeholder="Stored answer">
              <button class="btn btn-g" id="kbAdd">Add pair</button>
            </div>
            <div class="row-form wrap" style="margin-top:12px">
              <label class="sw-inline"><span>Active from (PKT)</span><input class="in" id="kbFrom" placeholder="09:00" style="flex:none;width:90px"></label>
              <label class="sw-inline"><span>until (PKT)</span><input class="in" id="kbTo" placeholder="21:00" style="flex:none;width:90px"></label>
              <input class="in" id="kbAllow" placeholder="Allowlist — phone numbers, comma separated (92300…)">
            </div>
            <div class="row-actions"><button class="btn btn-p" id="kbSave">Save hours &amp; allowlist</button></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ═══ AUTOMATION · DIGEST & TRANSLATE ═══ -->
      <section class="view" data-view="digest" hidden>
      <div class="vtab-row" role="tablist" aria-label="Analytics & Reports">
        <button class="vtab" data-go="analytics" role="tab">Analytics</button>
        <button class="vtab" data-go="digest" role="tab">Reports & Digest</button>
      </div>

        <div class="ph"><div class="ph-l"><h2>Reports and Digest</h2><div class="ph-d">Everything the bot reports back to you: the AI daily digest, the morning recap, the weekly report and instant failure alerts — all to your own number.</div></div></div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-h">AI digest</div>
          <div class="card-b"><div class="sw-grid" id="swDigest"></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-h">Settings</div>
          <div class="card-b">
            <p class="muted tiny f-help">Translate: every published post is translated to this language first. Digest: once a day the AI summarizes everything published into one “Daily Digest” post.</p>
            <div class="row-form wrap" style="margin-top:12px">
              <input class="in" id="translateLang" placeholder="Translate language — e.g. English or Urdu">
              <input class="in" id="digestAt" placeholder="Digest time (PKT), e.g. 22:00" style="flex:none;width:auto">
            </div>
            <div class="row-actions"><button class="btn btn-p" id="aiExtrasSave">Save</button></div>
          </div>
        </div>
