          <div class="card-b" style="border-top:1px solid var(--border)">
            <p class="muted tiny f-help">Every day at the time below, the bot sends YOU (your own number, from Settings · Reports) a plain-text recap of the last 24 hours: published / skipped / failed counts, the failed reasons, and what's scheduled next. Deterministic — no AI, nothing posted to any channel.</p>
            <div class="row-form wrap" style="margin-top:12px">
              <label class="sw-inline"><span>Recap time (PKT)</span><input class="in" id="recapAt" placeholder="07:00" style="flex:none;width:90px"></label>
