        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-h">Watched numbers <%- icon('eye','icon') %></div>
          <div class="card-b">
            <p class="muted tiny f-help">Useful for numbers that matter to you. For full contact notes, tags and timelines: WhatsApp tab → 📇 Contacts → the ℹ button on any contact.</p>
            <div class="row-form" style="margin-top:12px">
              <input class="in" id="watchPhone" placeholder="923001234567">
              <input class="in" id="watchName" placeholder="Name (optional)">
              <button class="btn btn-p" id="watchAdd" style="flex:none"><%- icon('plus','icon icon-xs') %> Watch</button>
            </div>
            <div class="tw" style="margin-top:12px"><table class="t" id="watchTable"><thead><tr><th>Number</th><th>Name</th><th>Last activity</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div>
            <p class="muted tiny f-help" style="margin-top:12px">If a watched number never shows activity: open that chat on your phone — if it says <b>invite</b> (not “typing…”), the number is dead / has no WhatsApp. Remove it here and unlink it from any groups.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ═══ OUTREACH · BULK SEND ═══ -->
      <section class="view" data-view="bulk" hidden>
