        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-h">Bulk sender <%- icon('megaphone','icon') %></div>
          <div class="card-b">
            <p class="muted tiny f-help">One recipient per line: <b>phone,name</b> or just <b>phone</b> (full format with country code) — or paste group IDs ending in <b>@g.us</b>. Use <b>{name}</b> in the message to personalize. Paced 1.5 s apart.</p>
            <div class="field" style="margin-top:12px"><textarea class="in" id="bulkTo" rows="5" placeholder="923001234567,Ali&#10;923009876543&#10;1203630…@g.us"></textarea></div>
            <div class="field" style="margin-top:12px"><textarea class="in" id="bulkText" rows="4" placeholder="Salam {name}! Here is today's update…"></textarea></div>
            <div class="row-actions"><button class="btn btn-p" id="bulkSendBtn"><%- icon('send','icon icon-xs') %> Send to all</button></div>
            <div id="bulkResult" class="muted tiny" style="margin-top:8px"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-h">Saved lists <%- icon('megaphone','icon') %></div>
          <div class="card-b">
            <p class="muted tiny f-help">Name a group of recipients once, send to the whole list any time. Same 1.5 s pacing and <b>{name}</b> personalization as the sender above — a list can never send faster than WhatsApp allows.</p>
            <div class="tw" style="margin-top:12px"><table class="t" id="bcListTable"><thead><tr><th>List</th><th class="num">Recipients</th><th>Updated</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div>
            <div class="row-actions" style="margin-top:10px"><button class="btn btn-p" id="bcNewList"><%- icon('plus','icon icon-xs') %> New list</button></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-h">Send history</div>
          <div class="card-b"><div class="tw"><table class="t" id="bulkHistTable"><thead><tr><th>When</th><th>List</th><th class="num">Sent</th><th class="num">Total</th><th>Message</th></tr></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ═══ OUTREACH · EMAIL ═══ -->
      <section class="view" data-view="email" hidden>
        <div class="ph"><div class="ph-l"><h2>Email</h2><div class="ph-d">Send emails from your own mail accounts — app password required.</div></div></div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-h">Email accounts <%- icon('mail','icon') %></div>
          <div class="card-b">
            <p class="muted tiny f-help">Send emails from your OWN Gmail / iCloud (or any provider — multiple accounts, switch senders any time). Each needs an <b>app password</b> — normal passwords are refused by Google and Apple.</p>
            <div class="tw" style="margin-top:12px"><table class="t" id="emAccTable"><thead><tr><th>Account</th><th>Provider</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div>
            <h3 style="margin-top:16px;font-size:var(--t14);font-weight:600">Connect another account</h3>
            <div class="row-form wrap" style="margin-top:12px">
              <select class="in" id="emProvider" title="Mail provider" style="flex:none;width:auto">
                <option value="gmail">Gmail</option><option value="icloud">ICloud Mail</option><option value="custom">Custom SMTP…</option>
              </select>
              <a class="btn" id="emPassLink" href="https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><%- icon('key','icon icon-xs') %> Get app password →</a>
            </div>
            <div class="row-form wrap" style="margin-top:12px">
              <input class="in" id="emLabel" placeholder="Account label (e.g. My Gmail)">
              <input class="in" id="emUser" type="email" placeholder="your.address@gmail.com">
              <input class="in" id="emPass" type="password" placeholder="App password (16 letters)">
            </div>
            <div class="row-form wrap" id="emCustomRow" hidden style="margin-top:12px">
              <input class="in" id="emHost" placeholder="SMTP host (e.g. smtp.office365.com)">
              <input class="in" id="emPort" type="number" placeholder="Port (587 or 465)" style="flex:none;width:auto">
            </div>
            <div class="row-actions"><button class="btn btn-p" id="emAdd">Connect account</button></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-h">Compose &amp; send</div>
          <div class="card-b">
            <div class="row-form wrap">
              <select class="in" id="emFrom" title="Send from"></select>
              <input class="in" id="emSubject" placeholder="Subject">
            </div>
            <div class="field" style="margin-top:12px"><textarea class="in" id="emTo" rows="4" placeholder="One recipient per line: someone@example.com or someone@example.com,Name — use {name} to personalize"></textarea></div>
            <div class="field" style="margin-top:12px"><textarea class="in" id="emBody" rows="5" placeholder="Your message… (Salam {name}! …)"></textarea></div>
            <div class="row-form wrap" style="margin-top:12px">
              <input class="in" id="emWhen" type="datetime-local" title="Leave empty to send now" style="flex:none;width:auto">
              <button class="btn btn-p" id="emSendNow" style="flex:none">Send now</button>
              <button class="btn" id="emSchedule" style="flex:none"><%- icon('calendar-clock','icon icon-xs') %> Schedule</button>
            </div>
            <p class="muted tiny f-help" style="margin-top:12px">Lists with more than 5 recipients send automatically in the background (paced, 1 email every 5 s) — watch the history below. Stay under ~150 emails/day on Gmail to avoid provider blocks. Channel posts are never auto-emailed.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-h">Scheduled (pending)</div>
          <div class="card-b"><div class="tw"><table class="t" id="emQueueTable"><thead><tr><th>Send at (UTC)</th><th>Subject</th><th>Status</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-h">Send history</div>
          <div class="card-b"><div class="tw"><table class="t" id="emHistTable"><thead><tr><th>When</th><th>From</th><th>To</th><th>Subject</th><th>Result</th></tr></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ═══ INSIGHTS · ANALYTICS ═══ -->
